(Amd. - SG, No. 102 of 2009, in force from 22.12.2009) (1) (Amd. - SG, No. 66 of 2023, in force from 01.01.2024, suppl. - SG, No. 69 of 2023) Domestic violence is any act of physical, sexual, psychological or economic violence, as well as an attempt at such violence, forced restriction of private life, personal freedom and personal rights, committed against persons who are in kinship, who are or have been in a family relationship or in de facto marital cohabitation or in an intimate relationship.
(1) (Amended - SG, issue 102 of 2009, effective 22.12.2009) The measures for protection from domestic violence are:

